    <title>Exporting user preferences</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="282" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Exporting user preferences
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="7" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="490">
      <col width="228">
      <col width="232">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Exporting user preferences</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="474">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="228">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="228">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.A window to enter the name of the external file is presented.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="228">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.If the filename is valid, customizable user's properties setting are
            exported.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.1.If the file is not valid, an error message is given and there is no
            export.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="228">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The export window is closed remaining the properties window
            showed.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="232">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p>
       &nbsp;
    </p>
